<DemoExample Title="External Icons" RazorCode="@example14RazorCode" CsharpCode="@example14CsharpCode" Id="example14" PreventRenderForMcpClient>
    <div>
        Besides the built-in icons of <b>IconName</b>, the <b>Icon</b> parameter of an option accepts the CSS
        classes of any external icon library, such as FontAwesome or Bootstrap Icons, and takes precedence over
        <b>IconName</b>. The same applies to the <b>ChevronDownIcon</b> of the nav itself.
    </div>
    <br /><br />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/7.0.1/css/all.min.css" />
