<DemoExample Title="Style & Class" RazorCode="@example16RazorCode" Id="example16" PreventRenderForMcpClient>
    <div>
        <b>Style</b> and <b>Class</b> reach the root element, the <b>Style</b> and <b>Class</b> of an option
        reach the list element of that option, and the <b>Styles</b> and <b>Classes</b> objects reach every
        part of the nav separately: the root, the item container and its selected variant, the item and its
        selected variant, the item icon and text, the toggle button and its chevron icon, the description, the
        group header and its text, and the separator.
